<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hyprop sells property for 47 million rand.</title>
<headline>Hyprop sells property for 47 million rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyprop Investments Ltd said on Thursday it had sold the East Rand Pick 'n Pay Hypermarket property to VKV Properties (Pty) Ltd for 47 million rand in cash.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
